+ *
+ * Patch 0283 (thermal parity with the DT trips; README-thermal.md "0283"). negronithermal=1 (default)
+ * replaces the one 70/60 C rule with per-zone trips of out/live.dts (thermal-zones), checked every second:
+ *   cpu-110C  any cpu-0-x/cpu-1-x core sensor >= 110 C (cpu4-emerg0-cfg :8042, cpu0-emerg-cfg :8509,
+ *             hysteresis 10 C): Android pauses the core (thermal-pause); we cannot, so the CPU cap goes to
+ *             the deepest row (negroni_cpufreq_cap(0): the ABL row, or the LUT minimum with 0291's
+ *             negronicpufreq_floor=lut).
+ *   gpu-95C   gpuss-0/1 >= 95 C (tj_cfg :8404/:8446, hysteresis 5 C) -> kgsl cooling 0..max (gpu0_cdev
+ *             :8414): the GPU cap goes down one level per second while above, up one per second below 90 C.
+ *   ipa-53C   the OPLUS IPA zone (oplus_thermal_ipa ipa-control-temp 53 C, hysteresis 2 C, :10275) ->
+ *             cpufreq cooling of the three clusters. Its sensor is an OPLUS virtual shell sensor (userspace
+ *             in Android); the proxy here is the skin thermistor pm8350_hot_pocket_therm (0x146) that the
+ *             battery service measures (modes 4/5) [I]. One CPU cap step per 10 s while above, back below 51 C.
+ *   xo-78C / xo-80C  xo-therm (pmk8350_xo_therm, :10087/:10094, hysteresis 8/10 C) -> cpu4/cpu7 freq
+ *             cooling, apc1 pause, gpu state 7 (:10132-10152); 80 C pauses cpu5-7: here both = the deepest CPU
+ *             row and GPU level 5 (421 MHz).
+ *   ddr-90C   ddr sensor >= 90 C (ddr0-config :8812, hysteresis 5 C) -> gold/gold-plus cpufreq cooling
+ *             (:8828): one CPU cap step per 10 s.
+ *   bcl-lvl0/1/2  PM8350B BCL status 0x4708 bits 0/1/2 (bcl_pmic5.c:27,41-43,495-507; the
+ *             pm8350b-bcl-lvlN zones :9602-9764): GPU state 2/4/7 -> level 10/8/5 (734/599/421 MHz),
+ *             cpu5 / cpu6+7 pause -> CPU cap 2400 / 1800 MHz [I: no pause here]; kept 10 s after the bit clears.
+ * The kgsl state k is DT pwrlevel k (818 MHz at 0 ... 220 MHz at 11, live.dts gpu-pwrlevels) = our level
+ * 12 - k (negroni_adreno.c gpu_khz). The GPU floor stays level 4 (350 MHz). The CPU cap is the deepest of
+ * all active trips (3200/2400/1800/1400/deepest). The charger FCC level of 0277 (qcom,thermal-mitigation
+ * 3000/1500/1000/500 mA, :6647; no DT zone uses it: the Android thermal HAL does) is set here [I design]:
+ * skin >= 45 C -> level 3 (1000 mA), ipa-53C or xo-78C -> level 4 (500 mA), back with 2 C hysteresis.
+ * negronithermal=2: the 0280 rule (hottest sensor 70/60 C). negronithermal=0: off (the fallback).
+ * The log line ends with the active trips: "| trip gpu-95C,bcl-lvl0" (or "| trip none").
  */
